@startuml INA700_overview
' INA700 - system overview
' Author: Suraj Karki
' Course: INA700 - AI-based pick and place
'
' The layering in one picture. Only one adapter per port is shown; the full
' set is in 03-ports-vision.puml and 04-ports-mapping-comms.puml.
' Dependencies point downward only.

title INA700 - architecture overview

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 12
skinparam ranksep 28
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam class {
  BorderColor #333333
  BackgroundColor #FDF6E8
  BackgroundColor<<port>> #EAF2FB
  BackgroundColor<<use case>> #EFF6EC
  BackgroundColor<<value>> #F2F2EE
  BackgroundColor<<utility>> #F2F2EE
}

package "infrastructure" as INFRA {
  class Container
  class ThreadSupervisor
  class config_loader <<utility>>
}

package "adapters  (I/O, swappable from config)" as ADAPT {
  class Camera
  class YoloDetector
  class HarmonicOrientationEstimator
  class HsvColourClassifier
  class ArucoCalibrator
  class segmentation <<utility>>
  class TcpServerTransport
  class TkView
}

package "ports  (abstract interfaces)" as PORTS {
  interface FrameSource <<port>>
  interface ObjectDetector <<port>>
  interface OrientationEstimator <<port>>
  interface ColourClassifier <<port>>
  interface CoordinateMapper <<port>>
  interface SceneCalibrator <<port>>
  interface ObjectSelector <<port>>
  interface RobotTransport <<port>>
  interface View <<port>>
}

package "application  (use cases)" as APP {
  class VisionPipeline <<use case>>
  class CoordinateService <<use case>>
  class CycleController <<use case>>
  class SharedState <<use case>>
}

package "domain  (pure rules, no I/O)" as DOMAIN {
  class Detection <<value>>
  class DetectedObject <<value>>
  class WorldPose <<value>>
  enum Shape
  class geometry <<utility>>
  class orientation <<utility>>
}

Camera ..|> FrameSource
YoloDetector ..|> ObjectDetector
HarmonicOrientationEstimator ..|> OrientationEstimator
HsvColourClassifier ..|> ColourClassifier
ArucoCalibrator ..|> SceneCalibrator
TcpServerTransport ..|> RobotTransport
TkView ..|> View

VisionPipeline --> ObjectDetector
VisionPipeline --> OrientationEstimator
VisionPipeline --> ColourClassifier
VisionPipeline --> SceneCalibrator
CycleController --> ObjectSelector
CycleController --> RobotTransport
CycleController --> CoordinateService
CycleController --> SharedState
TkView --> SharedState

VisionPipeline ..> Detection
CoordinateService ..> DetectedObject
CoordinateService ..> WorldPose
CoordinateService ..> geometry
HarmonicOrientationEstimator ..> orientation
HarmonicOrientationEstimator ..> segmentation
HsvColourClassifier ..> segmentation
Detection --> Shape

Container ..> config_loader : reads the profile through
Container ..> ADAPT : creates
Container ..> APP : wires
ThreadSupervisor ..> APP : runs on threads

note right of Container
  The only file that names a concrete class.
  Pick a profile and the same use cases run
  against a file replay, a mock detector and
  a loopback robot.
end note

note bottom of segmentation
  One definition of "the object" inside a
  detection box, shared by the orientation
  estimator and the colour classifier. A star
  fills barely a third of its box, so anything
  averaged over the box measures paper.
end note

' Hidden edges stack each package into a column. Without them PlantUML lays
' nine classes side by side and the picture is 3000 px wide and unreadable.
Camera -[hidden]down- YoloDetector
YoloDetector -[hidden]down- HarmonicOrientationEstimator
HarmonicOrientationEstimator -[hidden]down- HsvColourClassifier
HsvColourClassifier -[hidden]down- ArucoCalibrator
ArucoCalibrator -[hidden]down- TcpServerTransport
TcpServerTransport -[hidden]down- TkView
TkView -[hidden]down- segmentation

FrameSource -[hidden]down- ObjectDetector
ObjectDetector -[hidden]down- OrientationEstimator
OrientationEstimator -[hidden]down- ColourClassifier
ColourClassifier -[hidden]down- CoordinateMapper
CoordinateMapper -[hidden]down- SceneCalibrator
SceneCalibrator -[hidden]down- RobotTransport
RobotTransport -[hidden]down- ObjectSelector
ObjectSelector -[hidden]down- View

@enduml
